<h3>Who this is for</h3>

<p>Three people keep showing up in the research, and this pick belongs to all of them. The homeowner who's sick of dragging out a machine (or fifty feet of cord) for a five-minute job. The person whose hands, back or shoulders have had enough — the owners in their seventies and eighties writing <em>"It is perfect for me"</em> about featherweight blowers are the most relieved voices in this entire market. And the gas refugee who never wants to yank a cord again.</p>

<p>The person it's wrong for has half an acre of wet leaves and should scroll back up to rank 2. Everyone else: the whole kit is $69.99 at 50% off, it ships from Ohio in 2–3 days, and the maker's guarantee is 90 days, every penny, no questions asked. The next time the patio needs clearing, it takes one hand.</p>

